Platform	Stack
🍎 macOS	SwiftUI
🪟 Windows	C# + WinUI
🐧 Linux	Qt (C++)
📱 iOS	SwiftUI
🤖 Android	Kotlin + Compose

Global icons (public.global_icons + api/assets/global_icons/): use icon_path_* from API for CDN/local sync.
• Android (Compose): icon_path_android → bundled .xml vector drawable in res/drawable (or download from CDN).
• iOS / macOS (SwiftUI): icon_path_ios / icon_path_macos → SVG (iOS uses fill currentColor for template mode).
• Windows (WinUI): icon_path_windows → PNG 32×32 tiles.
• Linux (Qt): icon_path_linux → SVG (e.g. QSvgWidget / QIcon from file or network).

